lines:
You found the Root Fossil.{be01}
If this Fossil is taken, the other
one will sink into the sand...{be01}
Take the Root Fossil anyway?

You found the Claw Fossil.{be01}
If this Fossil is taken, the other
one will sink into the sand...{be01}
Take the Claw Fossil anyway?

I watered my plants lots and lots!
A whole bunch of flowers bloomed!{be01}
And then a whole bunch of Berries
appeared!{be01}
Here you go!
You can have this!

嗨！我想你是个旅行
者吧？{be01}
怎么样？跟我们家4
个人来几场{be00}
宝可梦对战吧？

哦，天啊，这么年轻
！{be01}
你就是那个打败了我
丈夫的训练家吧，{be01}
轮到我跟你对战了！

Find a big tree that looks like it might
drop some vines.{be01}
Use Secret Power in front of the tree.
Some vines should get free and drop{be00}
down, so you can climb the tree.{be01}
You’ll find a lot of space for putting
your favorite things.{be01}
It’ll be your own secret room...
A Secret Base!{be01}
You should make one, too.{be01}
Another thing, you don’t always have
to make your Secret Base in a tree.{be01}
Try using Secret Power on rock walls
that have small indents in them.{be01}
I’m going to look for other places, too.
Okay, bye!

Gabby: Wow, you are something!{be01}
You’ve gotten a lot stronger - a lot -
since we last battled.{be01}
We were right about you when we
spotted you as a hot Trainer.{be01}
So, anyway, what do you think?
Are you willing to give us an interview{be00}
this time?

玛莉：嗯，没错！这
句话作为结尾太完美
了！{be01}
我有预感这期节目一
定会很精彩。{be01}
说不定会在电视上播
出，记得关注我们哦
！{be01}
好！下次见！

如果你不继续训练宝
可梦，在水平越来越
高的对战中{be00}
将会难以持续获胜下
去。{be01}
我听说宝可梦联盟的
四天王的实力{be00}
比道馆馆主强多了。
